printing.invalid = Enteekateeka z’okukuba oba ebipimo by’ekifaananyi tebiri bituufu.
printing.limit = Omulimu gw’okukuba gusukka ekkomo: ebifaananyi 200, pikseli obukadde 40 oba pikseli 32768 ku buli ludda lwa buli kifaananyi, oba 256 MiB z’amawulire ga PDF agafunyiziddwa.
printing.profile_error = Ekifaananyi kino kirina pulofayiro y’amabara etali ntuufu, etakwatagana oba etawagirwa. CMYK/Lab eyasooka yeetaaga pulofayiro entuufu etekeddwamu; RGB yeetaaga pulofayiro ya RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Ku DPI y’ekiwandiiko, ekifaananyi kino tekigya mu kifo kino. Kozesa enkola ey’okutuukanya, olukomera olulina ebifo ebitono oba olupapula olunene.
printing.caption_limit = Ebigambo ebinyonnyola biwanvu nnyo ku lukomera luno. Kozesa ennyiriri oba empagi entono, bikendeeze oba bigyeko.
printing.font_error = Tewali nnukuta z’okukozesa ku bigambo ebinyonnyola. Teekako fonti y’ebigambo oba ggyako ebigambo ebinyonnyola.
printing.no_document = Ggulawo ekiwandiiko oba londa ebifaananyi mu galeriya nga tonnakuba.
printing.source_error = Ekifaananyi ekirondeddwa, fayiro ey’okubiri ekyusiddwa oba ebigambo ebinyonnyola tebisobose kusomebwa. Tewali PDF eterekeddwa.
printing.save_error = PDF tesobodde kuterekebwa. Londa erinnya lya fayiro eppya mu tterekero erikkirizibwa okuwandiikibwamu; fayiro eziriwo teziddizibwawo.
